      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11330973::web::025::discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine precipitates impede dislocation glide.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The introduced nanostructural barriers increase lattice friction.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11330973::web::025::discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Barriers to dislocation motion can produce significant strain hardening.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4682111::web::013::discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The treated alloy will have higher yield strength than the as-cast control because of improved dislocation pinning.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4682111::web::013::discussion",
        "PMC7921137::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC11330973::web::025::discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The treated alloy will have higher hardness than the as-cast control because of improved dislocation pinning.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The treated alloy will show enhanced strain-hardening behavior.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4682111::web::013::discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Some dislocation mobility will remain and preserve favorable plasticity.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4682111::web::013::discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The treatment will preserve favorable machinability.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The increase in strength and hardness may be accompanied by a moderate reduction in plastic strain.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
